            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.9.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "MAT.12.42"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Mat 12:42",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "LUK.11.31"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Luk 11:31",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omukamakati wa Seba obu yahuliireho okurangaanwa kwa Solomooni, akasendekerezibwa abantu baingi muno, obu aina engamiya ezeetwekere ebintu ebirukuboya, ezaabbu enyingi n'amabaale ag'omuhendo, yagenda Yerusaalemu kulengesa Solomooni, naamukaguza ebikaguzo ebigumire. Obuyahikire omuba Solomooni, akamugambira byona ebyakaba naatekereza, byona ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.9.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.9.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 9:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Byona ebi yakagwize, Solomooni akabigarukamu kurungi; hatabeho na kimu ekyamulemere kumusoborra. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.9.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.9.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 9:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omukamakati wa Seba obu yamazire kurora amagezi ga Solomooni, enju ei yayombekere, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.9.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.9.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 9:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ebyokulya ebya ha meeza ye, enyikarra ey'abanyoro be, n'empeereza ey'abaheereza be, eby'okujwara byabo, abaheereza be ab'embonekyo, ebyokujwara byabo, ebihongwa bye eby'okwokya ebi yahongaga omunju ya MUKAMA, yahunirra muno.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.9.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.9.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 9:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.9.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.9.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 9:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nukwo kugambira omukama ati, “Ebi nahulire ndi omunsi yange ha mirimo yawe na ha magezi gawe, by'amazima, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.9.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.9.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 9:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "baitu ebi nahuliire ntabiikirize, okuhika obu nakaizire nayerorra n'amaiso gange; ekicweka ekikooto ekya kabiri eky'amagezi gawe, ntakigambirwe; byona ebi nahuliire n'obikiraho. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.9.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.9.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 9:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bakazi bawe ka bakahiirwa! Abaheereza bawe banu abanyakwemerra butoosa omu maiso gawe, bakahurra amagezi gawe, ka bakahiirwa! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.9.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.9.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 9:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "MUKAMA Ruhanga wawe, ayakusiimire yakuta ha kitebe kye eky'obukama, obe omukama wa MUKAMA Ruhanga wawe, ahaisanizibwe! Habwokuba Ruhanga wawe akagonza Isirairi, kandi aligumya Abaisirairi ebiro byona, nikyo yakufooliire mukama obaleme, ogumye obwinganiza n'obuhikiriire.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.9.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.9.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 9:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hanyuma yaha omukama ezaabbu erukukira ha kiloguraamu enkumi ina, ebintu ebirukuboya bingi muno, n'amabaale ag'omuhendo: Hakaba hatakabahoga bintu ebirukuboya nk'ebi omukamakati wa Seba ebi yahaire Omukama Solomooni.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.9.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.9.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 9:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.9.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.9.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 9:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kandi ekindi, abaheereza ba Huuramu n'aba Solomooni abaihire ezaabbu Ofiri, bakaihayo n'emiti aligumu n'amabaale ag'omuhendo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.9.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.9.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 9:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Emiti egi aligumu, omukama akagikoramu amatembero agarukutwara omunju ya MUKAMA, n'agarukutwara omunju y'omukama; yakoramu enanga n'edongo eziteerwa abazini; ira lyona omunsi ya Yuda, hakaba hatakabamuga bintu nk'ebi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.9.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.9.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 9:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.9.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.9.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 9:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omukama Solomooni akaha omukamakati wa Seba ebintu byona ebi yagondeze, kyona eki yakasabire, okwihaho ebi, ebi yaletiire omukama. Hanyuma, yagaruka omunsi ye, hamu n'abaheereza be.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.9.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.9.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Itungo ly'Omukama Solomooni",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 9:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.9.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.9.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 9:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Buli mwaka, omukama Solomooni, yatungaga kiloguraamu z'ezaabbu, obukumi bubiri, omu nkumi isatu, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.9.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.9.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 9:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "otataireho n'egi eyaleetwaga abasuubuzi abato n'abakuru; abakama boona ab'Arabia, n'abalemi abakuru ab'ensi egi, na bo baaleeteraga Solomooni ezaabbu n'efeeza. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.9.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.9.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 9:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omukama Solomooni akaheesa engabu enkooto ez'ezaabbu enyakwagiibwe, buli ngabu emu, haagendamuga kiloguraamu z'ezaabbu nka musanju. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.9.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.9.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 9:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kandi yaheesa engabu entoito ebikumi bisatu, buli emu, haagendamuga kiloguraamu z'ezaabbu nka isatu; engabu ezi zoona, omukama akaita omunju ey'omu kibira kya Lebbanoni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.9.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.9.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 9:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omukama, kandi akakora ekitebe ky'obukama ekikooto eky'isanga, yakisiiga ezaabbu enungi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.9.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.9.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 9:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ekitebe eki, kikaba kiina amatembero mukaaga n'akatebe k'ezaabbu ak'okutaho ebigere, bikoliirwe ha kitebe eki, ha buli rubaju rwakyo, hakaba haroho eky'okutaho omukono, n'ebisisani by'entale ibiri, zeemeriire nambere harukutebwa emikono, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.9.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.9.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 9:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kandi ha buli rukarra rw'amatembero ago omukaaga nambere rurukugarukira heemeriireho ekisisani ky'entale. Ekitebe nk'eki, kikaba kitakakorwaga omu bukama obundi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.9.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.9.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 9:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ebyokunywisa",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.9.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.9.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9:20",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Ebyokunywisa omu businge bw'abakama byayetwaga embonekyo",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " by'omukama Solomooni byona, bikaba biri by'ezaabbu, n'ebikwato byona eby'omunju eyayetwaga Kibira kya Lebbanoni, bikaba biri by'ezaabbu enungi mali; omu businge bwa Solomooni, efeeza tiyayetwaga kintu ky'omuhendo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.9.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.9.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 9:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Habwokuba, emeeri z'omukama zaagendaga Tarusiisi hamu n'abaheereza ba Huramu; buli myaka esatu, emeeri zaagendaga Tarusiisi, ziihayo ezaabbu, efeeza, amasanga, ebikuya",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.9.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.9.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9:21",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Abandi ebikuya babyeta ebiteera",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " n'enkerebe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.9.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.9.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 9:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.9.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.9.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 9:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omukama Solomooni, nukwo kukirra kimu abakama boona ab'ensi yoona, omu itungo n'omu magezi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.9.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.9.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 9:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abakama boona ab'ensi yoona, baagonzaaga kurora Solomooni, bahurre amagezi ge, MUKAMA aga yamuhaire. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.9.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.9.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 9:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Buli omu yahikyaga ekisembo kye, ebintu eby'efeeza n'ezaabbu, eby'okujwara, emyamirro ebintu ebirukuboya, embaraasi, enyumbu, buli mwaka baaleetaga bingi muno. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.9.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.9.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 9:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1KI.4.26"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Bakam 4:26",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Solomooni akaba aina ebihongole by'embaraasi n'ebigaalii enkumi ina, abatembi b'embaraasi, akakumi kamu omu nkumi ibiri, aba yataga omu mbuga ezirumu ebigaali, abandi Yerusaalemu baikale hamu n'omukama. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.9.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.9.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 9:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "GEN.15.18"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Kub 15:18",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1KI.4.21"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Bakam 4:21",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Akalema abakama boona, okuruga Efuraate, okuhika hansi ey'Abafirisiti, na ha mutaano gwa Misiri. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.9.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.9.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 9:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omukama, omu rubuga Yerusaalemu, efeeza akagifoora kintu kya butoosa, nk'amabaale, kandi yakanyisa emikogoto, nk'emisikamooli ey'omu kyeya, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.9.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.9.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 9:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "DEU.17.16"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Bir 17:16",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Solomooni, baamuleeteraga embaraasi ezaarugaga Misiri, n'omunsi ezindi zoona.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.9.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.9.28"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
